mockgcp: serve compute vpnTunnels (insert, get, setLabels, delete)

Written here for config-connector-extensions' ComputeVPNTunnel: mockgcp
had no VPN tunnel service. Every field but the labels is set only by
insert, as in the real API; the shared secret is not returned, its hash
is; setLabels checks the label fingerprint. It does not check that the
gateways, peer or router exist.

